{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act39side","storySort":17,"storyDependence":"act39side_level_act39side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EP-8","storyName":"见证，征服，定义","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"哈维尔向胡安娜证明了自己有能力引导船员们走向另一个未来。棘刺却在和安纳斯塔西奥的对战中被逼入绝境，跳入正在喷发的蒸汽之中。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act39side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":15,"next":17,"characters":["极境","温蒂","安纳斯塔西奥","伊西多","蒂奇","帕斯卡拉","哈维尔","胡安娜","震惊的船员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_bg_57_g7_olddeck_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"0.6","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.4","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"0.4","channel":"1","delay":"0.7","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"1","channel":"2","delay":"1","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$calamity_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_calamity_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":11},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"我解决了！我把他们都解决了！……温蒂，你那里需要帮忙吗？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"不用，我也解决了——只要我刚修好的船别再被撞坏就好！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"好！呼……","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandstormimpact","volume":"0.8","id":22},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bone_rub","volume":"0.7","delay":"0.1","id":23},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"啧，我这辈子都不会再想去游乐场坐过山车了。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"等等，极境……你身上刚才还没有这么多血的！……是刚刚的骸骨碎片吗？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"multiline","name":"极境","text":"血……？","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"multiline","name":"极境","text":"没事，为好朋友受点小伤不算什么。棘刺有了想去做的事情，我要全力支持他才行。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"我先给你包扎一下……棘刺他想做什么？他说过吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"哎……等时候到了，让他亲口给你说！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_bg_57_g7_olddeck_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"啊，伊西多。你想赎自己的罪，想抹消自己对无辜之人产生的影响，将他们送回原本的生活轨迹。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"这究竟是你坚定的意志，还是良心的回照？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"毕竟，常有罪人在意识到自己已走上绝路时，恸哭着为他被连累的亲友求情……","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"但这并不代表他真心愧悔。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"一个不清楚自己欲望是什么的人，如何能证明，他有能力抑制那欲望，然后去赎那酿成的罪？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不。需要抑制欲望的人是你，需要证明自己的人也是你。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"……当然，我已说过，欲望无法被杀死。食人的欲望始终活在我的体内，我必须抑制它。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我会亲手剜下自己的血肉，然后将它弃置。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我会证明自己对血肉的渴望能够被抑制，哪怕只是瞬间。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多清楚地看到，安纳斯塔西奥从领口中露出的那些皮肤，都覆盖着丑陋的疤痕。被剜去又生长出来的血肉，如此难以直视。","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"你说，欲望只会无穷无尽地生长，将越来越多的人拖入深渊。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"你以此为由，审判过多少人，杀死过多少人？你为什么偏偏相信自己的欲望能被抑制？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"因为死亡是一种解脱。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"伊西多，在被欲望沾染之前，你还有过正常的生活，行过良善之事。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"所以在染上欲望之后，你有资格以死解脱。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"但我的生命，从最初就是一个错误，从最初就是一种罪孽。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我若是死去，那我这可悲的存在，除了亵渎之外，还能有什么意义？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"……所以我必须赎罪。在我的欲望发展到无法抑制的地步之前，我会尽我所能地赎罪。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"text","text":"安纳斯塔西奥左手的指甲嵌入自己的胸膛，唯有疼痛才能使他感到一丝安定。","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"你甚至在乎自己存在的意义。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"安纳斯塔西奥，你是真的不配死去，还是太想活着了？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"你总在谈论自己“食人的欲望”，可你最根深蒂固的欲望，难道不只是活着？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不论残害自己还是审判别人，你难道不只是为了让所谓“罪孽深重”的自己能安心地活着？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":90},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":92},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.9","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing1","volume":"1","delay":"0.2","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing2","volume":"1","delay":"0.7","id":96},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","volume":"1","delay":"0.9","id":97},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_cross","y":"150","layer":"1","id":100},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","y":"150","layer":"2","id":101},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"3","id":104},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_fold_hit","layer":"4","id":105},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","y":"-180","layer":"5","id":110},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_cross_hit","y":"-180","layer":"6","id":111},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.2","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"安纳斯塔西奥为了听取伊西多告解而放缓的攻势，转瞬间便重新凌厉起来。","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多每挡下一剑，手臂上的心相原质都会因剧烈的震动而丝丝缕缕地飘浮起来。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"你不愿告解，那就死。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_bg_57_g8_oldcabin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":128},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.9","id":129},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"35","ystrength":"35","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"小心！！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"妈的，爹的，吃鳞屎的！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":141},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":143},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cnstrctnck","volume":"1","id":147},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#13$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","afrom":"0","ato":"0","duration":"0","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#13$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1","duration":"0","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"整个伊比利亚就只有我们值得你们这么追吗？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.6","id":154},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"不过是一个罗盘！一个没人在意的破玩意！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"但我能拿到钱，我能不用再去做那些你们看不上，我也看不上的破事！！","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","text":"","id":160},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","delay":"0.5","text":"","id":161},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"你们为什么要一直追着我？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":168},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp5","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","delay":"0.2","id":170},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"你们没资格审判我……你们没资格……！","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"好了……好了！帕斯卡拉，帕斯卡拉！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"停下来，他们已经不会再还手了！","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"哈……哈……我……","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"停下来！……我……我们快……","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"4","times":"40","duration":"0.5","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"……快先换个地……地方……","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"啊……蒂奇……","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"蒂奇，你先别晕！你先别晕！我……我……","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"你要是晕了，我以后就请别人喝咸鳞汁，就不找你了！","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"你这话怎么说的像……像极境那个小子一样……油嘴滑舌的……","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"我像极境？那我这话是不是很好笑？是不是让你打起了精神？你别晕！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"好，我们先找个地方藏……藏起……","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":199},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":200},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"multiline","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"蒂奇……","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":206},{"type":"multiline","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"蒂奇！！","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":209},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":211},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":212,"musicid":1},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_57_i14_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"6","block":"false","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcket","volume":"1","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"帕斯卡拉惊慌失措地翻起身上的口袋。","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"口袋那么多，里面的东西多是她偷来，很少有属于她的。","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"她在里面终于翻到了些草药，颤抖着把它嚼碎，喂进蒂奇的嘴里。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"蒂奇在昏过去前，手臂还护着帕斯卡拉的头。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"帕斯卡拉把自己的脸贴在蒂奇的手臂上，努力感受着似乎慢慢回升的体温。","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_57_i14_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"她失去了很多东西，但这份温暖如今好像是属于她的了。","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":227},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"image","id":232},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_bg_57_g4_newdeck_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_chasing_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":235,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"胡安娜，这大概是我们最后一战了。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"这场战斗结束后，我们总有一个人会死在这里……","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我是他们的首领，你要是恨他们背叛了你，就都发泄在我身上！","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"然后呢？","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_singleblunt","volume":"1","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metalhammerhit","volume":"0.9","delay":"0.2","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metallicclick","volume":"0.9","delay":"0.5","id":251},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":252},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_cross","x":"-50","layer":"1","id":253},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_02_large","layer":"2","id":254},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","roy":"-90","layer":"3","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"要是我死了，不要迁怒那些船员！","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我用我的命保证，他们不会再有新的首领，会好好过自己想要的生活！","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1592_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"震惊的船员","text":"哈维尔……你……","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_npc_1592_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hammer","volume":"1","id":265},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.7","id":271},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tear","volume":"0.7","delay":"0.3","id":272},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜的回应是更猛烈的攻击。哈维尔的脊背被舵轮刮过，他咬牙忍住痛，随即找准机会砍出一刀。","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"将胡安娜的小臂砍得皮肉翻起，几乎见骨。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"要是我杀了你，我会拿着你的人头去换赏金！","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我会把钱分给他们每个人，让他们过上好日——","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_singleblunt","volume":"1","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hammer","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.2","id":285},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"35","ystrength":"35","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"喝——！","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":296},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"一次剧烈的颠簸，哈维尔踉跄几步，胡安娜却借势跃起，舵轮重重压在哈维尔身上，血和盐飞溅起来。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"他的武器已然断裂，他只能捏紧拳头，发疯般地捶打着胡安娜。","id":301},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#6$2","duration":"1","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"50","duration":"1","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"嗬……嗬……","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp4","id":309},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"35","ystrength":"35","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","delay":"0.1","id":311},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"哈维尔挣扎着从舵轮的重压下起身，胡安娜一拳将他打回血泊之中。","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"嗬……","id":315},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp2","id":317},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"35","ystrength":"35","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"他喘着粗气，喷着血沫，想要再次起身。胡安娜又是一拳，哈维尔的视野被一片血红浸透。","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"呃……","id":320},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"哈维尔再抽不出一丝力气，他几乎是在血泊里挣扎，却仍一次又一次徒劳地想要站起来。","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"直到他的双臂、双腿被舵轮压到脱臼。","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"他甚至没法再抬起自己的头。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"嗬……","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"……我输了……胡安娜……杀了我吧。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"等我……死了之后，不要迁怒剩下的那些船员……是我带领着他们背叛你的。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"……你杀了我，一切就结束了吧。","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"哈维尔看着胡安娜的眼睛。他觉得自己好像从来没这么近地直视过她的眼睛，他甚至在里面看到了自己的倒影。","id":330},{"type":"text","text":"他突然觉得自己还有些别的话想说。","id":331},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$storyendjp_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_storyendjp_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":333,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"那天……你从我窗前路过……我烤面包……那是第一次，烤得焦黑……是我失败了。","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"我浪费了珍贵的食物，船员们嫌弃，没人吃……只有你……","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"你从窗外路过，抓起一个面包，慢慢啃着……你边吃边露出了满足的神色……","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"那一个下午，你把那一整盘都吃光了……","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"那个时候我在想……为了让你再露出一丝满足的笑，我做什么都愿意。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"什么都愿意……","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"哈维尔闭上眼睛，等待着舵轮轧断他的脖子。","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"恭喜你，小哈。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"咳……咳……","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"这场新老首领之间的决斗，你赢了。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"现在，用你全部的力气站起来，走回去，去找你的船员们。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"……","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwlstps","volume":"1","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"哈维尔使出浑身的力气，想要站起身。","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"但地上鲜血黏腻，他再也没有力气挣扎，他只能缓慢地向前爬行着。","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1589_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1592_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":363},{"type":"charslot","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"但一个，两个，随后是一群。船员们一个接一个地跑了过来，从血泊中扶起他们奋战到最后一刻的新首领。","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"为了一场生死与共的拼杀而流出的血淌在一处，他们紧紧地搀扶着对方。","id":366},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_bg_57_g7_olddeck_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":373},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$corrosion_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act13d5d0/m_bat_corrosion_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":374,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"1","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","id":382},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.5","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多右臂上的心相原质跃动起来，他向背后划出一剑，旋身向右闪去。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"安纳斯塔西奥立刻紧逼上来，剑锋直指伊西多的咽喉。","id":389},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"在伊西多所预知的方向，滚烫的蒸汽从船的破洞中喷涌而出，截断了安纳斯塔西奥追击的步伐。","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多重新摆好架势，他看到，安纳斯塔西奥那被蒸汽灼烧过的手，握剑时没有丝毫颤抖。","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"……","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"text","text":"安纳斯塔西奥不会因蒸汽而退缩，他甚至渴求疼痛。","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"charslot","id":401},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordwhoosh","volume":"1","id":402},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metalcollar","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.3","id":403},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多俯身向蒸汽中刺出一剑。一声锐响，安纳斯塔西奥的长剑应声落地。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"但下一秒，安纳斯塔西奥的手炮已经抵在伊西多的眉心。","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1582_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"……","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1582_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"charslot","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"安纳斯塔西奥已然沉默，扣下扳机之前，他不会再言说。","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多被逼得连退几步，半个身子已在船外。","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"如果说曾经的你只是一个为了活命而挣扎的可怜孩子。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"那现在的你，已经在所谓“赎罪”的路上变成了双手染血的罪人。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1039_thorn2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"你，才是你自己最该杀死的人。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1039_thorn2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":423},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":424},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":426},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多纵身一跃。","id":427},{"type":"dialog","id":428},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gunsingle","volume":"0.9","id":429},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","volume":"0.4","id":430},{"type":"playsound","key":"$tactfulboost","volume":"0.3","id":431},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":434},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_57_i10.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"imagetween","image":"57_i10","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","block":"false","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":438},{"type":"text","text":"手炮发射的声响回荡在峡谷中，回响在中空的骨骸之中。","id":439},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多看见安纳斯塔西奥将手炮收回腰间，然后像重获新生般闭上双眼。","id":440},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多转头看到身下黑漆漆的空洞。骨骸中的热流与他手臂上的心相原质一齐涌动，他知道自己即将被蒸汽吞没。","id":441},{"type":"text","text":"但最后，他望向天空。","id":442},{"type":"text","text":"越过高耸的骨骸，透过蒸汽掀起的热浪，他看见那云与天，就如同传闻中泛着白色浪花的湛蓝汪洋。","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"那是他想要亲眼见证的大海。","id":444},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多向蒸汽的喷发孔坠去。","id":445},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"1","id":447},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"0.9","channel":"3","delay":"0.8","id":448},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"1","channel":"4","delay":"1.5","id":449},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"0.6","channel":"5","delay":"2.5","id":450},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steamburst_big","volume":"0.4","channel":"6","delay":"2.9","id":451},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":452},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":453},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":454},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":455},{"type":"charslot","id":456},{"type":"image","id":457}],"characters":["极境","温蒂","安纳斯塔西奥","伊西多","蒂奇","帕斯卡拉","哈维尔","胡安娜","震惊的船员"]}